{"ticker":"SHANKESH","symbol":"SHANKESH","instrumentId":3203860,"name":"Shankesh Jewellers Ltd","industry":"NSE-Retail/Whlsle-Jewelry","about":"Shankesh Jewellers manufactures and supplies customised handcrafted jewellery in 22 and 18 karat gold. Its portfolio includes bangles, bridal jewellery, chokers, jhumkas, necklace sets, mangalsutras, rings, and combined sets across antique, temple, Calcutta, semi antique, and other design categories. The company operates through two segments: sales of handcrafted gold jewellery and custom job work services using client supplied bullion. It follows an asset light manufacturing model by engaging skilled karigars and jobworkers while managing design, material sourcing, quality, and delivery internally. Shankesh Jewellers serves corporate and non corporate jewellery businesses across India, including large organised jewellery retailers.","website":"www.shankeshjewellers.com","location":null,"exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:57:13.592Z","basis":"standalone","price":{"value":84.2,"changePct":-3.562020387126331,"week52High":102.37,"week52Low":0},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹1,238 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹1,480 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"44,109,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"20"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"9,061,620"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"0.00%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"4.73"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"2"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"—"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"-0.15"},{"label":"Beta","value":"0.81"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"190%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"24.48"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"—"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"50.9%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"0.03"},{"label":"Volume","value":"3,165,802"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"4,310,383"},{"label":"Master score","value":"35"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"92"},{"label":"Price strength","value":"37"},{"label":"Group